OL,5,G0300 Secrets of the River Clyde
OL,6,     FThe River Clyde is one of
OL,7,     FBritain's most important rivers
OL,8,     Fwith an incredible history. It has
OL,9,     Fbeen a source of wealth and a
OL,10,     Fsymbol of pride for the great city
OL,11,     Fof Glasgow and for Scotland.
OL,12,G0345 Secrets of the River Mersey
OL,13,     FThe incredible history of the
OL,14,     FMersey. The river is at the heart
OL,15,     Fof the nation's shipbuilding
OL,16,     Findustry, and, during World War II
OL,17,     Fwould produce a new warship every
OL,18,     Fthree weeks.
